# Accepted findings for the Trivy image scan in CI.
# Each entry says why it does not apply here, and expires (exp:) so it is
# looked at again: after that date the scan fails on it once more.

# golang.org/x/net v0.58.0 in the docker compose plugin: denial of service via
# excessive HTTP/2 SETTINGS frames. No compose release has the fix yet
# (v5.6.1, the latest on 2026-10-24, still has v0.58.0). Compose here only
# talks to the local Docker daemon over its Unix socket (HTTP/1.1); image
# pulls are done by the daemon, not by compose. Every compose run also has a
# timeout and the container a memory limit. Update compose when a fixed
# release is out.
CVE-2026-78669 exp:2026-12-01
